File Index

/jest.config.cjs
Purpose: Self-contained node jest config for the simulacrum-server package, mirrors mud-builder-server's own.

/package.json
Purpose: Two-listener Node service (health/SSO/access-code Express API on 65000, gated TCP relay to merc-mud on 65001). build: tsc -p tsconfig.json then copies src/public into dist/public (the static sign-in page isn't TS, so tsc alone won't carry it).

/tsconfig.json
Purpose: NodeNext build config mirroring mud-builder-server's.
